<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission economic forecast for Germany.</title>
<headline>EU Commission economic forecast for Germany.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Germany:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		1.4	   2.2</p>
<p> Investment			1.1	   4.1</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    1.8	   1.7</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    9.0	   9.1</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 4.0	   2.9</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  60.8	 61.9</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
